## **Summary of Recommendations**
| **Question**               | **Answer**                                                                 |
|----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Dataset Structure**      | Follow `im1/`, `im2/`, `label1/`, `label2/` with `.tif`/`.png` files.      |
| **Resolution Mismatch**    | Upsample 0.035m → 0.05m using **Lanczos resampling** (GDAL/rasterio).      |
| **Non-512×512 Tiles**      | **Pad to 512×512** with `mode='reflect'` (simplest and most robust).       |
| **Normalization**          | Compute **per-temporal** mean/std (T1 and T2 separately).                |
| **Class Labels**           | Use **integer indices** (0=No Change, 1=Class1, etc.) in `.png` files.     |

